    "With nothing selected, only the icon is shown. ⌥-click the menu bar icon to open the other view; right-click to refresh or quit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个都不选就只显示图标。按住 ⌥ 点击菜单栏图标 = 另一种打开方式；右键有刷新和退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With vendor colors, models from the same vendor use shades of one hue (Claude terracotta, OpenAI teal, Google indigo); the color-blind safe scheme colors only the top three models by usage. Click a swatch to change its color; models switched off are left out of every statistic.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按厂商配色时，同一厂商的模型用同一色相的深浅区分（Claude 系赤陶、OpenAI 系青、Google 系靛蓝）；色盲友好方案只给用量前三的模型上色。点色块可以单独改颜色；关掉开关的模型不计入任何统计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
